<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - LSI Logic downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - LSI Logic downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan Securities said analyst Terry Ragsdale downgraded LSI Logic Corp to market performer from buy citing the stock's &quot;rich valuation.&quot;</p>
<p>-- In a report, said &quot;we believe further appreciation in the stock will be limited by top-line uncertainty.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Shares were off one to 38-3/8.</p>
</text>
